	001000 FileVers         =""
	001005 DefTitle         ="Fiat Coupe 16V Turbo with immobiliser"
	001007 DescSize         =0x165
	001006 Desc             ="Modified by KJ.  MAP breakpoints corrected.  RPM breakpoints corrected. MAP breakpoints are now in bar-absolute.  Injection cell values are now whole numbers from 0-255.  This xdf still needs work (see individual table descriptions), but it is good enough to make decent tunes.  If you can further improve this xdf email me (KJ) at: kahinde2000@yahoo.co.uk"
